Package: shinypak
Title: Clone and Launch 'Shiny' App Examples
Version: 0.1.1
Author: Martin Frigaard <mjfrigaard@pm.me> [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Martin Frigaard <mjfrigaard@pm.me>
Description: Clones branches of the 'sap' example repository into a local
    project, stripping development artifacts and renaming the '.Rproj' file
    to match the branch. Provides functions to list available app branches,
    launch installed examples, and verify a directory has a valid R package
    structure. Companion package to the Shiny App-Packages book
    <https://mjfrigaard.github.io/shiny-app-pkgs/>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://mjfrigaard.github.io/shinypak/,
    https://github.com/mjfrigaard/shinypak
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
Imports: 
    cli,
    gert,
    pkgload,
    readr,
    rstudioapi,
    shiny,
    withr
Suggests: 
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: 
    knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
